# ==============================================================================
# ZSH TOOL INSTALL MANIFEST
# Shared tool definitions readable by both Bash installer and ZSH framework.
# ==============================================================================
#
# Format: name:binary:description:category:replaces:brew:apt
#
# Fields:
#   name      - Human-readable tool name
#   binary    - Command name to check if installed
#   description - Short description
#   category  - essential, recommended, or extra
#   replaces  - Classic command this replaces (empty = supplement)
#   brew      - Homebrew package name (SCRIPT = needs custom install)
#   apt       - APT package name (SCRIPT = needs custom install)
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Empty lines are ignored.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Prompt & History ---
starship:starship:Cross-shell prompt with git integration:essential::starship:SCRIPT
atuin:atuin:Searchable shell history synced across machines:essential::atuin:SCRIPT

# --- File Operations ---
eza:eza:Colorful file listing with icons and git status:recommended:ls:eza:eza
bat:bat:File viewer with syntax highlighting and git diffs:recommended:cat:bat:bat
fd:fd:Fast and friendly file finder:recommended::fd:fd-find
ripgrep:rg:Extremely fast text search in files:recommended::ripgrep:ripgrep
sd:sd:Intuitive find-and-replace (simpler than sed):recommended::sd:sd

# --- Navigation ---
fzf:fzf:Fuzzy finder for files, history, and everything:recommended::fzf:SCRIPT
zoxide:zoxide:Smart directory jumper that learns your habits:recommended:cd:zoxide:zoxide
yazi:yazi:Terminal file manager with image preview:recommended::yazi:SCRIPT

# --- Disk & System ---
dust:dust:Intuitive disk usage viewer with visual bars:recommended:du:dust:dust
duf:duf:Pretty disk free output with colors:recommended:df:duf:duf
btm:btm:Visual system monitor dashboard:recommended:top:bottom:SCRIPT
procs:procs:Modern process viewer with color and tree:extra::procs:SCRIPT
fastfetch:fastfetch:Fast system information display:extra::fastfetch:fastfetch

# --- Git ---
delta:delta:Beautiful side-by-side git diffs:recommended::git-delta:git-delta
lazygit:lazygit:Simple terminal UI for git commands:recommended::lazygit:lazygit
gh:gh:GitHub CLI for PRs, issues, repos:recommended::gh:gh

# --- Network ---
gping:gping:Ping with a real-time graph:extra:ping:gping:gping
trippy:trip:Visual network path analyzer:extra:traceroute:trippy:SCRIPT
xh:xh:Friendly HTTP client with colors and JSON:extra::xh:xh
bandwhich:bandwhich:Per-process bandwidth monitor:extra::bandwhich:SCRIPT

# --- Productivity ---
tldr:tldr:Practical command examples (simpler than man):recommended::tealdeer:SCRIPT
hyperfine:hyperfine:Accurate command benchmarking tool:extra::hyperfine:hyperfine
topgrade:topgrade:Upgrade all tools with one command:recommended::topgrade:SCRIPT
direnv:direnv:Per-directory environment variables:extra::direnv:direnv
yq:yq:YAML/JSON/XML processor (like jq for YAML):extra::yq:yq
just:just:Simple command runner (Makefile alternative):extra::just:just

# --- macOS only ---
mas:mas:Mac App Store CLI:extra::mas:
